From 9dba6047aab243efb17e22a095dfba670b26ed1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: atomozero <bernardi.andrea@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:25:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 155/203] sdhci: add a device tree attachment, with NVIDIA
 Tegra 2 support

Controllers described in a flattened device tree are matched by their
compatible string. For "nvidia,tegra20-sdhci" the attachment powers the
slot through its power GPIO, sets up the module clock in the clock and reset
controller (the boot loader only does it for the controllers it used),
and describes the quirks of the controller. Card detection through the
cd-gpios GPIO is not done yet: the card is taken as present.

Used for the SD slot and the eMMC of the Toshiba AC100.
---
